  {
    "type": "NarrativeText",
    "element_id": "06111683e82bf05766800905b28dd190",
    "text": "Back after upload takes you to wrong screen plus caching issues",
    "metadata": {
      "languages": [
        "eng"
      ],
      "filename": "18393.txt",
      "filetype": "text/plain",
      "parent_id": "e1689bdb7dc24c1ea34a8e6746f02aa1",
      "data_source": {
        "url": null,
        "version": null,
        "record_locator": {
          "id": "18393",
          "key": "MAP-539",
          "board_id": null,
          "project_id": "MAP"
        },
        "date_created": "2025-03-10T04:39:43.091+0000",
        "date_modified": "2025-04-04T05:58:35.542+0000",
        "date_processed": "1744461415.3389282",
        "permissions_data": null,
        "filesize_bytes": 1495
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "NarrativeText",
    "element_id": "473789b48760a2a31c40c685267b70e6",
    "text": "I was creating a new map, i searched for the unit, selected it, uploaded the document, hit map, and then hit back (in mapper not the browser) and i was expecting to go back to the upload screen as i wanted to see the estimated credit usage, instead it took me back to the search screen, i then had to research for the unit i wanted, reselect it and then when i got back to the upload screen, the document was still there.",
    "metadata": {
      "languages": [
        "eng"
      ],
      "filename": "18393.txt",
      "filetype": "text/plain",
      "parent_id": "e1689bdb7dc24c1ea34a8e6746f02aa1",
      "data_source": {
        "url": null,
        "version": null,
        "record_locator": {
          "id": "18393",
          "key": "MAP-539",
          "board_id": null,
          "project_id": "MAP"
        },
        "date_created": "2025-03-10T04:39:43.091+0000",
        "date_modified": "2025-04-04T05:58:35.542+0000",
        "date_processed": "1744461415.3389282",
        "permissions_data": null,
        "filesize_bytes": 1495
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "NarrativeText",
    "element_id": "4173927d106078d47bf581003b0b2bee",
    "text": "Fix the back button so it takes me back to the upload screen with my document if possible.",
    "metadata": {
      "languages": [
        "eng"
      ],
      "filename": "18393.txt",
      "filetype": "text/plain",
      "parent_id": "e1689bdb7dc24c1ea34a8e6746f02aa1",
      "data_source": {
        "url": null,
        "version": null,
        "record_locator": {
          "id": "18393",
          "key": "MAP-539",
          "board_id": null,
          "project_id": "MAP"
        },
        "date_created": "2025-03-10T04:39:43.091+0000",
        "date_modified": "2025-04-04T05:58:35.542+0000",
        "date_processed": "1744461415.3389282",
        "permissions_data": null,
        "filesize_bytes": 1495
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "NarrativeText",
    "element_id": "388a72bd42d1fca5304bea90f79c195e",
    "text": "Also - if i go back and then instead select another unit the document is still there. In this case i think it should be gone.",
    "metadata": {
      "languages": [
        "eng"
      ],
      "filename": "18393.txt",
      "filetype": "text/plain",
      "parent_id": "e1689bdb7dc24c1ea34a8e6746f02aa1",
      "data_source": {
        "url": null,
        "version": null,
        "record_locator": {
          "id": "18393",
          "key": "MAP-539",
          "board_id": null,
          "project_id": "MAP"
        },
        "date_created": "2025-03-10T04:39:43.091+0000",
        "date_modified": "2025-04-04T05:58:35.542+0000",
        "date_processed": "1744461415.3389282",
        "permissions_data": null,
        "filesize_bytes": 1495
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "NarrativeText",
    "element_id": "7b8c19aadb43da6414c4f5b915802076",
    "text": "Also - if i select a certificate and select multiple units, it adds the document to all units tabs in the upload screen.",
